{"arm": "vs", "model": "z-ai/glm-5.3-flashx", "i": 8, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Editorial calm \u2014 generous whitespace, serif headlines, soft ocean-inspired palette, feels like a well-set magazine about teamwork", "probability": 0.3}, {"direction": "Product-led interactive demo \u2014 the hero IS a working mini week-planner you can drag tasks in, showing the tool instead of telling", "probability": 0.35}, {"direction": "Warm human collage \u2014 hand-drawn shapes, sticky-note textures, playful rotated cards evoking a team whiteboard", "probability": 0.2}, {"direction": "Dark focused workspace \u2014 moody deep-teal dark mode, glowing gradients, aimed at async remote teams", "probability": 0.1}, {"direction": "Brutalist minimal \u2014 stark type, grid lines, near-monochrome, one accent color, ultra-fast feel", "probability": 0.05}], "pick": {"direction": "Editorial calm \u2014 generous whitespace, serif headlines, soft ocean-inspired palette, feels like a well-set magazine about teamwork", "probability": 0.3}, "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tidepool \u2014 Plan your week together</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --ink:#12303b;\n    --ink-soft:#41626e;\n    --sea:#0e6b7a;\n    --foam:#f4f8f8;\n    --shell:#fdfcf9;\n    --sand:#f0ede5;\n    --kelp:#7fb8a8;\n    --coral:#e8a087;\n    --hair:#dde6e6;\n    --serif:'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;\n    --sans:'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  }\n  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}\n  body{background:var(--shell);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n\n  /* ---------- shared ---------- */\n  .wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px}\n  .kicker{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sea)}\n  h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n  p.lede{font-size:19px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.75}\n  .rule{width:56px;height:2px;background:var(--kelp);border:none;margin:28px 0}\n  .btn{display:inline-block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;transition:all .2s ease}\n  .btn-primary{background:var(--sea);color:#fff}\n  .btn-primary:hover{background:#0a5561;transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .btn-ghost{color:var(--sea);padding:14px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--kelp);border-radius:0}\n  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--sea)}\n  .eyebrow-num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:15px;color:var(--kelp);font-style:italic}\n\n  /* ---------- nav ---------- */\n  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(253,252,249,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}\n  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px}\n  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}\n  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:36px;align-items:center}\n  .nav-links a{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-soft);text-decoration:none}\n  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--sea)}\n  .nav-cta{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sea)!important}\n  @media(max-width:720px){.nav-links a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}}\n\n  /* ---------- hero ---------- */\n  .hero{padding:110px 0 90px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:72px;align-items:center}\n  @media(max-width:860px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:56px}}\n  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,68px);line-height:1.08;margin:24px 0 28px}\n  .hero h1 em{font-style:italic;color:var(--sea)}\n  .hero .lede{max-width:44ch;margin-bottom:40px}\n  .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .hero-note{margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n  .byline{margin-top:64px;display:flex;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .byline div strong{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:26px;font-weight:500;display:block}\n  .byline div span{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n\n  /* hero illustration: a week as tide chart */\n  .tide-card{background:var(--foam);border:1px solid var(--hair);border-radius:20px;padding:32px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px -30px rgba(14,107,122,.25)}\n  .tide-card h4{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:20px}\n  .tide-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .tide-row:last-child{margin-bottom:0}\n  .tide-day{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n  .tide-bar{height:34px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}\n  .b1{background:var(--sea);width:82%}\n  .b2{background:var(--kelp);width:56%;color:#0e3b33}\n  .b3{background:var(--coral);width:44%;color:#6b3520}\n  .b4{background:#bcd8d3;width:64%;color:#123}\n  .b5{background:#e8d9c4;width:38%;color:#5c4a2f}\n  .tide-spacer{height:34px}\n  .tide-foot{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--hair);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n  .pulse{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--kelp);margin-right:8px;animation:pulse 2.4s infinite}\n  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.35}}\n\n  /* wave divider */\n  .wave{display:block;width:100%;height:60px}\n  .wave path{fill:var(--sand)}\n\n  /* ---------- editorial section ---------- */\n  .editorial{background:var(--sand);padding:96px 0}\n  .editorial .head{max-width:560px;margin-bottom:72px}\n  .editorial h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.15;margin-top:20px}\n  .essays{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:48px}\n  @media(max-width:860px){.essays{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:56px}}\n  .essay{border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding-top:24px}\n  .essay h3{font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;margin:12px 0 14px}\n  .essay p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n  .essay a{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sea);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--kelp)}\n  .essay a:hover{border-color:var(--sea)}\n\n  /* ---------- quote ---------- */\n  .quote{padding:120px 0;text-align:center}\n  .quote blockquote{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);line-height:1.4;max-width:24ch;margin:32px auto}\n  .quote blockquote em{color:var(--sea)}\n  .quote cite{font-style:normal;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n\n  /* ---------- how ---------- */\n  .how{padding:0 0 120px}\n  .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--hair)}\n  @media(max-width:860px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  .step{padding:48px 36px 48px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hair)}\n  .step:not(:last-child){border-right:1px solid var(--hair);padding-right:36px}\n  @media(max-width:860px){.step{border-right:none!important;padding-right:0}}\n  .step .num{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:44px;color:var(--kelp);line-height:1}\n  .step h3{font-size:23px;margin:20px 0 12px}\n  .step p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft)}\n\n  /* ---------- CTA ---------- */\n  .cta{background:var(--sea);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:110px 32px}\n  .cta h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,52px);max-width:18ch;margin:20px auto 32px;line-height:1.15}\n  .cta .kicker{color:#a9d4cf}\n  .cta p{color:#cfe6e3;max-width:46ch;margin:0 auto 40px}\n  .btn-light{background:#fff;color:var(--sea)}\n  .btn-light:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}\n  .cta small{display:block;margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#9ec9c4}\n\n  footer{background:var(--ink);color:#9db4bb;padding:56px 0}\n  .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px}\n  .foot .logo{color:#fff}\n  .foot nav{display:flex;gap:28px}\n  .foot nav a{color:#9db4bb;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}\n  .foot nav a:hover{color:#fff}\n  .foot small{font-size:12px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<header>\n  <div class=\"wrap nav\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#\">\n      <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#0e6b7a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <path d=\"M4 14c2.5-3 5-3 7.5 0s5 3 7.5 0\" stroke=\"#7fb8a8\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      Tidepool\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n      <a href=\"#why\">Why Tidepool</a>\n      <a href=\"#how\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Pricing</a>\n      <a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"#start\">Start free \u2192</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"kicker\">Weekly planning, together</span>\n      <h1>Plan the week like a <em>calm</em> crew, not a fire drill.</h1>\n      <p class=\"lede\">Tidepool gathers your small team every Monday for a gentle fifteen-minute ritual: share what matters, spot the collisions, and leave with a week everyone believes in.</p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#start\">Start your first tide</a>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#how\">See how it works</a>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"hero-note\">Free for teams of up to five \u00b7 No credit card, ever.</p>\n      <div class=\"byline\">\n        <div><strong>2,400+</strong><span>small teams afloat</span></div>\n        <div><strong>15 min</strong><span>weekly ritual</span></div>\n        <div><strong>0</strong><span>status meetings reclaimed</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"tide-card\" aria-label=\"Example weekly plan\">\n      <h4>Wren Studio \u00b7 Week of May 12</h4>\n      <div class=\"tide-row\"><span class=\"tide-day\">Mon</span><div class=\"tide-bar b1\">Weekly tide \u00b7 9:15</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tide-row\"><span class=\"tide-day\">Tue</span><div class=\"tide-bar b2\">Deep work: onboarding</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tide-row\"><span class=\"tide-day\">Wed</span><div class=\"tide-bar b3\">Client review, Meridian</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tide-row\"><span class=\"tide-day\">Thu</span><div class=\"tide-bar b4\">Pairing: pricing page</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tide-row\"><span class=\"tide-day\">Fri</span><div class=\"tide-bar b5\">Show &amp; tide \u00b7 4pm</div></div>\n      <div class=\"tide-foot\">\n        <span><span class=\"pulse\"></span>Everyone has checked in</span>\n        <span>3 of 4 tides calm</span>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<svg class=\"wave\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 60\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M0,32 C240,64 480,0 720,20 C960,40 1200,10 1440,36 L1440,60 L0,60 Z\"/>\n</svg>\n\n<!-- EDITORIAL -->\n<section class=\"editorial\" id=\"why\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <span class=\"kicker\">Why Tidepool</span>\n      <h2>Small teams don\u2019t need more process. They need a better rhythm.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"essays\">\n      <article class=\"essay\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow-num\">No. 01</span>\n        <h3>One shared horizon</h3>\n        <p>Instead of five calendars and a dozen pings, Tidepool lays the week out on a single canvas. Every commitment is visible, every load is honest \u2014 before the week begins, not after it capsizes.</p>\n        <a href=\"#how\">Read more</a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"essay\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow-num\">No. 02</span>\n        <h3>Ritual over status meeting</h3>\n        <p>The Monday tide replaces the check-in that could have been an email. Fifteen minutes, one prompt, everyone heard. It\u2019s the meeting worth keeping \u2014 and nothing else stands in its way.</p>\n        <a href=\"#how\">Read more</a>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"essay\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow-num\">No. 03</span>\n        <h3>Capacity, made kind</h3>\n        <p>Tidepool reads the week like a tide chart: when the water is high, it nudges you to defer; when it\u2019s low, it protects the deep work. Saying \u201cnot this week\u201d becomes normal, not awkward.</p>\n        <a href=\"#how\">Read more</a>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- QUOTE -->\n<section class=\"quote\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"kicker\">From the field notes</span>\n    <blockquote>\u201cWe deleted four recurring meetings. Our Monday tide is the <em>only</em> sync left \u2014 and somehow it\u2019s the one nobody skips.\u201d</blockquote>\n    <cite>Mara Okafor \u00b7 Founding partner, Wren Studio</cite>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- HOW -->\n<section class=\"how\" id=\"how\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"head\" style=\"max-width:560px;margin-bottom:56px\">\n      <span class=\"kicker\">How it works</span>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,44px);margin-top:20px\">A rhythm in three simple movements.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"steps\">\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">i.</div>\n        <h3>Set the tide</h3>\n        <p>Monday morning, everyone answers three quiet questions: what matters, what\u2019s blocked, and how full their week already feels.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">ii.</div>\n        <h3>Chart the week</h3>\n        <p>Tidepool weaves the answers into one shared plan \u2014 flagging overloads, collisions, and the work that quietly slipped away last week.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">iii.</div>\n        <h3>Drift, together</h3>\n        <p>Through the week, plans bend without breaking. Friday\u2019s gentle recap closes the loop, so next Monday starts honest.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- CTA -->\n<section class=\"cta\" id=\"start\">\n  <span class=\"kicker\">Begin gently</span>\n  <h2>Your best week is one calm ritual away.</h2>\n  <p>Invite your team, run your first tide on Monday, and feel the difference by Friday. Free while you\u2019re small \u2014 like most good things should be.</p>\n  <a class=\"btn btn-light\" href=\"#\">Start your first tide \u2014 it\u2019s free</a>\n  <small>No credit card \u00b7 Up to 5 teammates free \u00b7 Set up in under 3 minutes</small>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n  <div class=\"wrap foot\">\n    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#\">\n      <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 26\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" r=\"12\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <path d=\"M4 14c2.5-3 5-3 7.5 0s5 3 7.5 0\" stroke=\"#7fb8a8\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n      Tidepool\n    </a>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#why\">Why</a>\n      <a href=\"#how\">How</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Field notes</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Privacy</a>\n    </nav>\n    <small>\u00a9 2025 Tidepool \u00b7 Made slowly, by a small team</small>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}